<title>POLAND: NOVITA SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.03 MLN.</title>
<headline>NOVITA SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.03 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.03 vs   0.91</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.39 vs   1.02</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.63 vs   1.35</p>
<p> Sales		    8.07 vs   7.31</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.17 vs   2.61</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.24 vs   2.94</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.13 vs   3.08</p>
<p> Sales		   47.21 vs  38.37</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Novita SA. The</p>
<p>comany said its investment relief for September was 813,500</p>
<p>zlotys and 1.34 million zlotys for the January-September period.</p>
<p>It said it had put aside 249,000 zlotys and 536,00 zlotys as</p>
<p>reserve for income tax in September and January-September period</p>
<p>respectively.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
